        <Key ID="STR_awsr_movement_SETTING_allowedAnimationArray">
            <English>Animation Whitelist</English>
            <German>Animations Whitelist</German>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_awsr_movement_SETTING_allowedAnimationArray_DESC">
            <English>Extra animations for this group,\ncomma separated. Case does not matter.\n\n* works as a wildcard: melee_armed_*\ncovers every name starting that way.\n\nExample: melee_armed_walkf, melee_turnl</English>
            <German>Zusätzliche Animationen dieser Gruppe,\nper Komma getrennt. Groß/klein egal.\n\n* ist ein Platzhalter: melee_armed_*\nerfasst jeden Namen, der so beginnt.\n\nBeispiel: melee_armed_walkf, melee_turnl</German>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_awsr_movement_SETTING_notAllowedAnimationArray">
            <English>Animation Blacklist</English>
            <German>Animations Blacklist</German>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_awsr_movement_SETTING_notAllowedAnimationArray_DESC">
